// [73] sovereign-lowering envelope (): the official-translator envelope validates (shape + consumer
// compat + real artifact hashes) and is consumable by check_compatibility.py directly; incompatible
// dialect, missing language version, absolute+traversal artifact paths (POSIX & Windows), and malformed
// sourceHash/capabilityVersion each fail closed; the published schema path pattern matches the
// validator. See check_sovereign_envelope.py.
//
// RUN: python3 %S/check_sovereign_envelope.py %scripts/validators/validate_sovereign_envelope.py \
// RUN:   %scripts/gates/check_compatibility.py %examples %docs/schemas/sovereign-lowering-envelope.schema.json
